me>Theoret</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Soran</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wickerham</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>The effect on tumor response of adding sequential preoperative docetaxel to preoperative doxorubicin and cyclophosphamide: preliminary results from National Surgical Adjuvant Breast and Bowel Project Protocol B-27</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2003</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>4165</fpage><lpage>4174</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14559892</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1200/JCO.2003.12.005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bear</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Geyer</surname><given-names>CE</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Mamounas</surname><given-names>EP</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Robidaux</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Margolese</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kahlenberg</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Sequential preoperative or postoperative docetaxel added to preoperative doxorubicin plus cyclophosphamide for operable breast cancer: National Surgical Adjuvant Breast and Bowel Project Protocol B-27</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2006</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>2019</fpage><lpage>2027</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16606972</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1200/JCO.2005.04.1665</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><perso